  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Listening was designed and printed by Julie Chen in an edition of 75 copies. Papers used include Fabriano Ingres Heavyweight and handmade sheets from the St.-Armand paper mill. Typefaces used include Copperplate Gothic and Adobe Garamond ... The boxes were made by Sandy Tilcock"--Colophon</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Signed and numbered by author.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Each leaf consists of 2 layered paper boards attached to continuous heavy paper strip; concertina binding; 2 loops attached to front and back covers for use with accompanying ties; paper label on front cover.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">In box (11 x 13 cm.), closed with 3-fold flap, 3rd flap is magnetic; mounted pocket on inside spine with 2 ribbon and button ties; mounted paper tuck wrapper contains 1 leaf (folded to form 6 leaves)--of instructions for making headdresses with book; paper labels on front cover and spine.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Letterpress printed.</subfield>
  </datafield>
